research/audit/wave7-topology-uniform.proof-contracts.json-345-          "fact": "L1",
research/audit/wave7-topology-uniform.proof-contracts.json-346-          "source": "thm-uniformity-induces-a-topology",
research/audit/wave7-topology-uniform.proof-contracts.json-347-          "source_section": "Statement",
research/audit/wave7-topology-uniform.proof-contracts.json-348-          "quote": "For a uniformity $\\mathcal U$ on $X$, call $O\\subseteq X$ open when every $x\\in O$ has an entourage $E$ with $E[x]\\subseteq O$. These open sets form a topology on $X$. Its neighbourhood filter at $x$ has $\\{E[x]:E\\in\\mathcal U\\}$ as a base.",
