research/audit/wave7-topology-uniform.proof-contracts.json-2968-          "quote": "If $\\mathcal U$ is a uniformity on $X$, then its symmetric entourages form a filter base: for every $E\\in\\mathcal U$ there is a symmetric $D\\in\\mathcal U$ with $D\\subseteq E$. More generally, for every entourage $E$ and every integer $n\\ge 1$, there is a symmetric entourage $D$ whose $n$-fold composite satisfies $D^{\\circ n}\\subseteq E$.",
