research/audit/wave7-topology-uniform.proof-contracts.json-3846-          "claim": "Let $V$ be a target entourage and choose a symmetric $W$ with $W^{-1}\\circ W=W^{\\circ2}\\subseteq V$. For each $x\\in X$, let $O_x$ be the union of all open sets $O$ such that $x\\in O$ and $f[O]\\subseteq W[f(x)]$. Continuity makes this family nonempty, and its union is an open neighbourhood of $x$ satisfying $f[O_x]\\subseteq W[f(x)]$. [L2, L3, construct]",
